# Claude Code: merge into .mcp.json (`mcpdef connect claude-code --write` does it)
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "mcpdef": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp"
    }
  }
}

# or, for every project rather than this one:
claude mcp add --transport http --scope user mcpdef https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp

The gateway's certificate is from its own CA. Before starting Claude Code: export NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS=$DIR/state/tls/ca.crt
